# Broadcast Rambler (5/4 Vehicle, Crew 1): "When this Vehicle enters, create a 1/1 colorless Thopter artifact creature token with
# flying" (CR 111.1, 603.6a). The Thopter, whose power is exactly the 1 that Crew 1 needs, taps to crew it (CR 702.122a); Bot2's Savannah
# Lions is not a creature Bot1 controls, so Bot1 cannot choose it, and the crewed Rambler is a 5/4 artifact creature. The Thopter first
# attacks in the air for 1 on turn 3 and, tapped, leaves Bot1 nothing to crew with until turn 5 (a Crew 0 would not need it).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Sapphire
Mox Emerald
Broadcast Rambler
Island
Island x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Savannah Lions
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Broadcast Rambler.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Types = Artifact; Creature
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Savannah Lions.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Thopter Token > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
# The tapped Thopter is the only creature Bot1 has: nothing is left to crew with (CR 702.122a).
! Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Activate(Ability: Crew)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Types = Artifact
Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Activate(Ability: Crew)
! Bot1.Choose(Savannah Lions)
Bot1.Choose(Thopter Token)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Power = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Toughness = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Keywords = Flying
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Colors = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Thopter Token.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Types = Artifact; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Power = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Broadcast Rambler.Toughness = 4
Bot2.Battlefield.Savannah Lions.Tapped = false
Bot2.Life = 19
